# The repository lives inside the game folder, so everything is ignored except the mod sources.
*
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!CMakeLists.txt
!include/
!include/**
!src/
!src/**
!docs/
!docs/AUTO_UPDATE.md
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/bench.ps1
!tools/po_symbols.py
!tools/package_release.py
!tools/update_test_server/
!tools/update_test_server/**

!Mods/
Mods/*
!Mods/Mods.ini
!Mods/README.md
!Mods/*/
!Mods/*/*.cpp
!Mods/*/*.h
!Mods/*/*.manifest
!Mods/*/README.md
!Mods/PerformanceOptimizer/PerformanceOptimizer.ini
